  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ability to heal others is significantly increased.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Efficient Aid.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The damage healed through the use of request aid is increased by 50%. In addition, if you expend one use of mythic power, you can cure a number of points of ability damage equal to your mythic tier to the target. The target creature specifies which ability damage to heal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
